---
// About — biography + pull-quote + portrait
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '~/assets/images/portrait.jpg';
---

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Biography</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">American Metal, Melodic Heart</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about">
      <div class="about__body">
        <p>
          Dean Cascione is an American Metal guitarist and an innovative force in
          today's instrumental rock scene. Committed to shattering shred
          stereotypes, he delivers melodic music, charged with passion and
          contrast.
        </p>

        <div class="about__quote">
          A showcase of Neoclassical fretboard pyrotechnics… channels the spirit
          of Rhoads and the best of Malmsteen.
          <span class="about__attrib">— Press</span>
        </div>

        <p>
          Praised as &ldquo;dangerous with a guitar&rdquo; and &ldquo;a bright
          star on the international guitar scene,&rdquo; Dean has released
          multiple acclaimed albums and collaborated with legends in the metal
          world. His debut <em>Guitar Chop Shop</em> topped charts in 2008, and
          he's continued to push boundaries with releases like
          <em>Neoclassical Fire</em> (2011) and <em>Shred Crusade</em> (2015).
        </p>

        <p>
          In 2010, Dean recorded with MANOWAR on the worldwide release
          <em>MAGIC: A Tribute to Ronnie James Dio</em>. Drawing inspiration from
          Cacophony &amp; Racer X, he joined forces with &ldquo;Guitar
          Maxx&rdquo; Maxxwell Carlisle to release several singles. Dean has
          performed at festivals, clinics, and shows across the country.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="about__portrait">
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="Dean Cascione — portrait"
          widths={[300, 480, 640]}
          sizes="(max-width: 880px) 100vw, 480px"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
